  <body dur="05:09.420">
    <div begin="00:02.020" end="05:09.420">
      <p begin="00:02.020" end="00:04.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:02.020" end="00:02.250">最</span><span begin="00:02.330" end="00:02.580">近</span><span begin="00:02.580" end="00:02.780">は</span><span begin="00:03.050" end="00:03.170">上</span><span begin="00:03.170" end="00:03.310">手</span><span begin="00:03.310" end="00:03.410">く</span><span begin="00:03.410" end="00:03.550">や</span><span begin="00:03.550" end="00:03.640">れ</span><span begin="00:03.720" end="00:03.810">て</span><span begin="00:03.810" end="00:03.900">い</span><span begin="00:03.900" end="00:04.060">る</span><span begin="00:04.060" end="00:04.180">気</span><span begin="00:04.180" end="00:04.340">が</span><span begin="00:04.340" end="00:04.470">す</span><span begin="00:04.470" end="00:04.650">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最近总觉得 自己似乎过得还算不错</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">最近總覺得 自己似乎過得還算不錯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Lately I feel like I've been doing pretty well</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">요즘은 제법 잘해 나가고 있는 것 같아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai l’impression que dernièrement je m’en sors plutôt bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Últimamente siento que las cosas me están saliendo bien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In letzter Zeit habe ich das Gefühl ganz gut zurechtzukommen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ultimamente sinto que tenho me saído bem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В последнее время мне кажется что я неплохо справляюсь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ultimamente mi sembra di cavarmela piuttosto bene</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Saikin wa umaku yarete iru ki ga suru</span></p>
      <p begin="00:05.270" end="00:08.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:05.270" end="00:05.510">任</span><span begin="00:05.510" end="00:05.660">さ</span><span begin="00:05.660" end="00:05.800">れ</span><span begin="00:05.800" end="00:05.920">た</span><span begin="00:05.920" end="00:06.180">事</span><span begin="00:06.180" end="00:06.290">を</span><span begin="00:06.650" end="00:06.770">ちゃ</span><span begin="00:06.770" end="00:06.900">ん</span><span begin="00:06.900" end="00:07.010">と</span><span begin="00:07.010" end="00:07.150">こ</span><span begin="00:07.150" end="00:07.260">な</span><span begin="00:07.260" end="00:07.350">せ</span><span begin="00:07.440" end="00:07.550">て</span><span begin="00:07.550" end="00:07.650">い</span><span begin="00:07.650" end="00:07.770">る</span><span begin="00:07.770" end="00:08.110">筈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交付于我的事情 应该也都有好好完成</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">交付於我的事情 應該也都有好好完成</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I should be handling everything I've been entrusted with</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">맡겨진 일도 제대로 해내고 있을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je devrais réussir correctement tout ce qu’on m’a confié</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se supone que cumplo bien con todo lo que me encargan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eigentlich müsste ich alles schaffen was man mir anvertraut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Acho que tenho feito direito tudo o que me confiaram</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наверное я как следует делаю всё что мне поручают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dovrei riuscire a fare come si deve tutto ciò che mi viene affidato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Makasareta koto o chanto konasete iru hazu</span></p>
      <p begin="00:08.780" end="00:10.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:08.780" end="00:08.890">言</span><span begin="00:08.890" end="00:09.010">う</span><span begin="00:09.010" end="00:09.170">ほ</span><span begin="00:09.170" end="00:09.280">ど</span><span begin="00:09.280" end="00:09.440">不</span><span begin="00:09.440" end="00:09.600">自</span><span begin="00:09.600" end="00:09.770">由</span><span begin="00:09.770" end="00:09.940">も</span><span begin="00:09.940" end="00:10.030">な</span><span begin="00:10.030" end="00:10.160">い</span><span begin="00:10.160" end="00:10.420">生</span><span begin="00:10.420" end="00:10.790">活</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活也并没有多么不自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生活也並沒有多麼不自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A life that's not really all that restrictive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇게까지 자유롭지 못한 삶도 아니고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une vie où au fond je ne manque pas vraiment de liberté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tampoco llevo una vida tan limitada como para quejarme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Leben das gar nicht so unfrei ist wie man meinen könnte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma vida que nem chega a ser tão limitada assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Да и жизнь нельзя назвать такой уж несвободной</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una vita che in fondo non è poi così priva di libertà</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Iu hodo fujiyuu mo nai seikatsu</span></p>
      <p begin="00:11.210" end="00:13.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:11.210" end="00:11.470">大</span><span begin="00:11.470" end="00:11.730">丈</span><span begin="00:11.730" end="00:11.860">夫</span><span begin="00:11.860" end="00:11.890">、</span><span begin="00:12.270" end="00:12.410">ちゃ</span><span begin="00:12.410" end="00:12.530">ん</span><span begin="00:12.530" end="00:12.670">と</span><span begin="00:12.670" end="00:12.820">出</span><span begin="00:12.820" end="00:12.950">来</span><span begin="00:12.950" end="00:13.070">て</span><span begin="00:13.070" end="00:13.170">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系 我都有好好做到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沒關係 我都有好好做到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's okay I'm doing everything right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">괜찮아 제대로 하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ça va je fais tout comme il faut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Estoy bien lo estoy haciendo como debo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles gut ich kriege das schon hin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Está tudo bem estou conseguindo fazer tudo direito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё хорошо я всё делаю как надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Va tutto bene riesco a fare tutto come si deve</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Daijoubu, chanto dekiteru</span></p>
      <p begin="00:13.830" end="00:15.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:13.830" end="00:13.980">だ</span><span begin="00:13.980" end="00:14.140">け</span><span begin="00:14.140" end="00:14.330">ど</span><span begin="00:14.330" end="00:14.360">、</span><span begin="00:14.710" end="00:14.820">な</span><span begin="00:14.820" end="00:14.930">ん</span><span begin="00:14.930" end="00:15.070">で</span><span begin="00:15.070" end="00:15.210">だ</span><span begin="00:15.210" end="00:15.370">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是 为什么呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可是 為什麼呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But why is that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런데 왜일까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais alors pourquoi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero no sé por qué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Aber warum nur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas então por quê</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но почему же тогда</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure chissà perché</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakedo, nande darou</span></p>
      <p begin="00:15.920" end="00:17.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:15.920" end="00:16.170">笑</span><span begin="00:16.170" end="00:16.310">っ</span><span begin="00:16.310" end="00:16.450">た</span><span begin="00:16.450" end="00:16.720">顔</span><span begin="00:16.720" end="00:16.890">が</span><span begin="00:16.890" end="00:17.050">キ</span><span begin="00:17.050" end="00:17.190">モ</span><span begin="00:17.190" end="00:17.330">チ</span><span begin="00:17.330" end="00:17.500">ワ</span><span begin="00:17.500" end="00:17.610">ル</span><span begin="00:17.610" end="00:17.680">イ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">笑起来的这张脸 让我觉得恶心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">笑起來的這張臉 讓我覺得噁心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My smiling face makes me sick</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃고 있는 내 얼굴이 역겨워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon visage quand je souris me dégoûte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi cara cuando sonrío me da asco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein lächelndes Gesicht widert mich an</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu rosto sorrindo me dá repulsa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мне противно моё улыбающееся лицо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio volto quando sorride mi fa ribrezzo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Waratta kao ga kimochiwarui</span></p>
      <p begin="00:18.510" end="00:21.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.680">そ</span><span begin="00:18.680" end="00:18.820">れ</span><span begin="00:18.820" end="00:18.950">以</span><span begin="00:18.950" end="00:19.250">前</span><span begin="00:19.250" end="00:19.370">に</span><span begin="00:19.980" end="00:20.120">な</span><span begin="00:20.120" end="00:20.210">ん</span><span begin="00:20.210" end="00:20.310">で</span><span begin="00:20.310" end="00:20.720">私</span><span begin="00:20.720" end="00:20.850">は</span><span begin="00:20.850" end="00:21.070">笑</span><span begin="00:21.070" end="00:21.220">っ</span><span begin="00:21.220" end="00:21.330">て</span><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:21.420">い</span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.590">る</span><span begin="00:21.590" end="00:21.680">の</span><span begin="00:21.680" end="00:21.710">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不 在那之前 我究竟为什么还在笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不 在那之前 我究竟為什麼還在笑呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">More importantly why am I even smiling?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그보다도 나는 대체 왜 웃고 있는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et avant même ça pourquoi est-ce que je souris ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y antes que nada ¿por qué estoy sonriendo?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und überhaupt warum lache ich eigentlich?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Antes de tudo por que estou sorrindo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И вообще почему я улыбаюсь?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anzi prima ancora perché sto sorridendo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore izen ni nande watashi wa waratte iru no?</span></p>
      <p begin="00:24.220" end="00:29.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:24.220" end="00:24.810">昨日</span><span begin="00:24.810" end="00:25.070">を</span><span begin="00:25.630" end="00:25.860">そ</span><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.040">の</span><span begin="00:26.040" end="00:26.160">ま</span><span begin="00:26.250" end="00:26.530">ま</span><span begin="00:27.070" end="00:27.280">貼</span><span begin="00:27.280" end="00:27.520">り</span><span begin="00:27.630" end="00:27.880">付</span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.440">け</span><span begin="00:28.530" end="00:28.750">て</span><span begin="00:28.750" end="00:29.440">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是把昨天原封不动地贴到今天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只是把昨天原封不動地貼到今天</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I keep pasting yesterday onto today</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어제를 그대로 오늘에 붙여 놓고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recolle hier tel quel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pego el ayer tal cual sobre el día de hoy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich klebe einfach das Gestern wieder auf das Heute</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só continuo colando o ontem sobre o hoje</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я просто наклеиваю вчерашний день поверх сегодняшнего</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuo a incollare ieri così com'era</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kinou o sono mama haritsuketeru</span></p>
      <p begin="00:29.960" end="00:34.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:29.960" end="00:30.310">毎</span><span begin="00:30.310" end="00:30.860">日</span><span begin="00:31.360" end="00:31.550">繰</span><span begin="00:31.550" end="00:31.820">り</span><span begin="00:31.910" end="00:32.670">返</span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.780">し</span><span begin="00:32.860" end="00:33.060">て</span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:34.370">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">日复一日地重复着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">日復一日地重複著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Repeating it day after day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">매일같이 되풀이하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et je recommence chaque jour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo repito todos los días</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und wiederhole jeden Tag aufs Neue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Repetindo isso todos os dias</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И повторяю это каждый день</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E a ripeterlo ogni giorno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mainichi kurikaeshiteru</span></p>
      <p begin="00:34.770" end="00:40.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:34.770" end="00:34.940">気</span><span begin="00:34.940" end="00:35.070">付</span><span begin="00:35.150" end="00:35.340">け</span><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.560">ば</span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:35.800">自</span><span begin="00:35.880" end="00:36.230">分</span><span begin="00:36.230" end="00:36.490">の</span><span begin="00:37.100" end="00:37.290">ガ</span><span begin="00:37.290" end="00:37.470">ワ</span><span begin="00:37.470" end="00:37.600">だ</span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:38.000">け</span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:38.620">生</span><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:38.970">か</span><span begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.440">さ</span><span begin="00:39.440" end="00:39.880">れ</span><span begin="00:39.980" end="00:40.200">て</span><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.700">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回过神时 仿佛只有我的躯壳还在继续活着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">回過神時 彷彿只有我的軀殼還在繼續活著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Before I knew it only my outer shell was being kept alive</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">정신을 차려 보니 내 껍데기만 살아가고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand je m’en rends compte seule mon enveloppe est encore maintenue en vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando me doy cuenta solo mantienen viva mi carcasa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ehe ich es merke wird nur noch meine äußere Hülle am Leben gehalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando percebi só a minha casca continuava viva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Не заметила как в живых осталась лишь моя оболочка</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando me ne accorgo è rimasto in vita soltanto il mio involucro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizukeba jibun no gawa dake ikasareteru</span></p>
      <p begin="00:41.230" end="00:45.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.590">中</span><span begin="00:41.590" end="00:41.780">身</span><span begin="00:41.780" end="00:42.270">は</span><span begin="00:42.620" end="00:42.740">呼</span><span begin="00:42.820" end="00:43.450">吸</span><span begin="00:43.450" end="00:43.700">を</span><span begin="00:44.060" end="00:44.270">や</span><span begin="00:44.270" end="00:44.370">め</span><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:44.680">た</span><span begin="00:44.680" end="00:45.750">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">里面的我 早已停止呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">裡面的我 早已停止呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The self inside stopped breathing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 안의 나는 이미 숨 쉬기를 멈췄어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce qu’il y avait à l’intérieur a cessé de respirer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo que había dentro dejó de respirar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während das Innere aufgehört hat zu atmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O que havia dentro de mim parou de respirar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А то что внутри перестало дышать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dentro di me ho smesso di respirare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nakami wa kokyuu o yameta no</span></p>
      <p begin="00:46.200" end="00:51.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.940">色</span><span begin="00:46.940" end="00:47.240">を</span><span begin="00:47.240" end="00:47.450">捨</span><span begin="00:47.450" end="00:47.640">て</span><span begin="00:47.640" end="00:48.020">た</span><span begin="00:48.500" end="00:48.620">世</span><span begin="00:48.710" end="00:49.100">界</span><span begin="00:49.100" end="00:49.500">に</span><span begin="00:50.000" end="00:50.420">並</span><span begin="00:50.420" end="00:50.520">ん</span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.670">だ</span><span begin="00:50.670" end="00:51.050">数</span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:51.240">字</span><span begin="00:51.240" end="00:51.560">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">舍弃了色彩的世界里 排列着一串串数字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">捨棄了色彩的世界裡 排列著一串串數字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The numbers lined up in a world drained of color</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">색을 버린 세계에 늘어선 숫자들은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les chiffres alignés dans un monde dépouillé de ses couleurs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los números alineados en un mundo despojado de color</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Zahlen aufgereiht in einer Welt die all ihre Farben abgelegt hat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Os números alinhados neste mundo que abandonou as cores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Цифры выстроенные в мире отбросившем все краски</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">I numeri allineati in un mondo che ha gettato via i colori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Iro o suteta sekai ni naranda suuji wa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:52.110" end="00:57.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:52.110" end="00:52.210">間</span><span begin="00:52.300" end="00:53.000">違</span><span begin="00:53.000" end="00:53.200">い</span><span begin="00:53.200" end="00:53.390">の</span><span begin="00:53.390" end="00:53.760">な</span><span begin="00:53.760" end="00:53.860">い</span><span begin="00:54.270" end="00:54.840">答</span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.160">え</span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.530">を</span><span begin="00:55.530" end="00:55.850">出</span><span begin="00:55.850" end="00:55.990">し</span><span begin="00:56.110" end="00:57.220">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们给出毫无差错的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">它們給出毫無差錯的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Always arrive at an answer that cannot be wrong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">틀림없는 정답을 내놓고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Donnent une réponse qui ne peut être fausse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dan una respuesta que nunca se equivoca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liefern eine Antwort ohne jeden Fehler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sempre apresentam uma resposta sem erro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всегда дают безошибочный ответ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Danno risposte che non possono essere sbagliate</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Machigai no nai kotae o dashite</span></p>
      <p begin="00:57.640" end="01:03.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:57.640" end="00:58.380">例</span><span begin="00:58.380" end="00:58.600">え</span><span begin="00:58.690" end="00:58.910">そ</span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.100">れ</span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.450">が</span><span begin="00:59.960" end="01:00.120">悲</span><span begin="01:00.120" end="01:00.510">劇</span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.870">に</span><span begin="01:01.400" end="01:02.280">導</span><span begin="01:02.280" end="01:02.490">い</span><span begin="01:02.490" end="01:02.690">て</span><span begin="01:02.690" end="01:03.010">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使那个答案终将把一切引向悲剧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱使那個答案終將把一切引向悲劇</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if that answer leads to tragedy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">설령 그 답이 비극으로 이끈다 해도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si cette réponse mène à la tragédie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque esa respuesta conduzca a una tragedia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn sie uns in eine Tragödie führt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que ela nos conduza à tragédia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И даже если он ведёт к трагедии</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se quelle risposte conducono alla tragedia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tatoe sore ga higeki ni michibiite mo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:03.350" end="01:09.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:03.350" end="01:03.720">そ</span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:03.900">れ</span><span begin="01:03.900" end="01:04.130">で</span><span begin="01:04.130" end="01:04.900">も</span><span begin="01:05.460" end="01:06.120">正</span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.790">解</span><span begin="01:06.790" end="01:06.990">な</span><span begin="01:06.990" end="01:09.270">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它依然会被称作正确</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">它依然會被稱作正確</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's still the right answer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 그게 정답인 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Elle reste malgré tout la bonne réponse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aun así sigue siendo la respuesta correcta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bleibt sie trotzdem die richtige Antwort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda assim continua sendo a resposta certa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё равно он считается правильным</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Restano comunque corrette</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore demo seikai na no</span></p>
      <p begin="01:09.950" end="01:15.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:09.950" end="01:10.550">心</span><span begin="01:10.550" end="01:10.820">は</span><span begin="01:11.410" end="01:11.560">誤</span><span begin="01:11.560" end="01:11.800">作</span><span begin="01:11.800" end="01:12.240">動</span><span begin="01:12.820" end="01:12.990">起</span><span begin="01:12.990" end="01:13.220">こ</span><span begin="01:13.310" end="01:13.580">す</span><span begin="01:13.710" end="01:14.160">だ</span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.490">け</span><span begin="01:14.490" end="01:15.140">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若所谓的心 不过只会发生故障</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若所謂的心 不過只會發生故障</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If the heart does nothing but malfunction</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음은 그저 오작동만 일으키고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si le cœur ne fait que dysfonctionner</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si el corazón no hace más que funcionar mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn das Herz doch nur Fehlfunktionen verursacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se o coração não passa de algo que funciona mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если сердце только и умеет что давать сбои</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se il cuore non fa altro che funzionare male</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro wa gosadou okosu dake de</span></p>
      <p begin="01:15.680" end="01:20.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:15.680" end="01:15.830">要</span><span begin="01:15.830" end="01:16.040">ら</span><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.250">な</span><span begin="01:16.250" end="01:16.580">い</span><span begin="01:17.100" end="01:17.290">と</span><span begin="01:17.290" end="01:17.380">言</span><span begin="01:17.380" end="01:18.040">う</span><span begin="01:18.040" end="01:18.560">の</span><span begin="01:18.560" end="01:18.780">な</span><span begin="01:18.780" end="01:20.070">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你说它根本不需要存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若你說它根本不需要存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you say we don't need it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">필요 없는 거라고 말할 거라면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si tu dis qu’on n’en a pas besoin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y dices que no hace falta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und man sagt dass wir es nicht brauchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E dizem que não precisamos dele</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если оно вам не нужно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E dite che non serve</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Iranai to iu no nara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:20.510" end="01:26.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:20.510" end="01:20.830">どう</span><span begin="01:20.830" end="01:20.990">し</span><span begin="01:21.080" end="01:21.310">て</span><span begin="01:21.440" end="01:21.600">ベ</span><span begin="01:21.600" end="01:21.700">ル</span><span begin="01:21.780" end="01:21.970">ト</span><span begin="01:21.970" end="01:22.260">で</span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:23.180">繋</span><span begin="01:23.180" end="01:23.410">い</span><span begin="01:23.410" end="01:23.660">で</span><span begin="01:24.240" end="01:24.340">み</span><span begin="01:24.430" end="01:24.930">た</span><span begin="01:24.930" end="01:25.060">り</span><span begin="01:25.160" end="01:25.560">し</span><span begin="01:25.690" end="01:25.810">て</span><span begin="01:25.900" end="01:26.460">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那又为什么偏偏用束带将它系在身上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那又為什麼偏偏用束帶將它繫在身上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then why fasten it to us with a belt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">왜 굳이 벨트로 이어 붙여서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors pourquoi nous l’attacher avec une sangle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entonces por qué lo ataste con una correa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum hast du es dann mit einem Gurt an uns gebunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então por que tentaram prendê-lo a nós com um cinto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тогда зачем вы пристегнули его к нам ремнём</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Allora perché avete provato a legarlo a noi con una cinghia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doushite beruto de tsunaide mitari shite sa</span></p>
      <p begin="01:26.930" end="01:31.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:26.930" end="01:27.460">必</span><span begin="01:27.550" end="01:28.020">ず</span><span begin="01:28.400" end="01:28.530">み</span><span begin="01:28.530" end="01:28.740">ん</span><span begin="01:28.740" end="01:28.970">な</span><span begin="01:28.970" end="01:29.370">に</span><span begin="01:29.770" end="01:29.960">付</span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:30.070">け</span><span begin="01:30.150" end="01:30.380">た</span><span begin="01:30.380" end="01:31.040">の</span><span begin="01:31.040" end="01:31.070">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么非得给每个人都装上一个呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為什麼非得給每個人都裝上一個呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Why make sure every one of us had one?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">빠짐없이 모두에게 달아 놓은 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pourquoi en avoir forcément donné un à chacun ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y te aseguraste de ponérselo a todo el mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warum musste wirklich jeder eines bekommen?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por que fizeram questão de dar um a todos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И непременно дали каждому?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché avete fatto in modo che tutti ne avessero uno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanarazu minna ni tsuketa no?</span></p>
      <p begin="01:31.410" end="01:37.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:31.410" end="01:31.980">辛</span><span begin="01:31.980" end="01:32.320">い</span><span begin="01:32.320" end="01:32.830">だ</span><span begin="01:32.830" end="01:33.010">け</span><span begin="01:33.010" end="01:33.230">だ</span><span begin="01:33.230" end="01:33.630">よ</span> <span begin="01:34.190" end="01:34.380">憂</span><span begin="01:34.380" end="01:35.070">鬱</span><span begin="01:35.170" end="01:35.650">な</span><span begin="01:35.650" end="01:35.800">だ</span><span begin="01:35.880" end="01:36.930">け</span><span begin="01:36.930" end="01:37.320">だ</span><span begin="01:37.320" end="01:37.940">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它只会让我痛苦 只会让我忧郁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">它只會讓我痛苦 只會讓我憂鬱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It only hurts It only leaves me miserable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 괴로울 뿐이야 우울할 뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ça ne fait que faire mal ça ne fait que m’accabler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo duele solo me llena de tristeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es tut doch nur weh es macht doch nur schwermütig</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só dói só me deixa deprimida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">От него лишь боль лишь тоска</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa soltanto male porta soltanto malinconia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsurai dake da yo yuuutsu na dake da yo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:38.400" end="01:43.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:38.400" end="01:38.750">こ</span><span begin="01:38.750" end="01:39.090">ん</span><span begin="01:39.090" end="01:39.330">な</span><span begin="01:39.440" end="01:39.750">も</span><span begin="01:39.840" end="01:40.150">の</span><span begin="01:40.150" end="01:40.520">が</span><span begin="01:40.520" end="01:40.750">此</span><span begin="01:40.840" end="01:41.260">処</span><span begin="01:41.260" end="01:41.600">に</span><span begin="01:41.600" end="01:41.940">あ</span><span begin="01:41.940" end="01:42.140">る</span><span begin="01:42.270" end="01:42.640">所</span><span begin="01:42.640" end="01:42.910">為</span><span begin="01:43.000" end="01:43.620">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是因为这样的东西还留在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">全都是因為這樣的東西還留在這裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">All because something like this exists inside me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이런 게 여기 존재하는 탓에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout ça à cause d’une chose pareille qui existe ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo por tener algo así aquí dentro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur weil so etwas hier in mir existiert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo porque uma coisa dessas existe aqui dentro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё потому что оно зачем-то находится здесь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Solo perché una cosa simile esiste qui dentro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Konna mono ga koko ni aru sei de</span></p>
      <p begin="01:44.080" end="01:49.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:44.080" end="01:44.270">捨</span><span begin="01:44.430" end="01:44.940">て</span><span begin="01:44.940" end="01:45.200">ら</span><span begin="01:45.200" end="01:45.560">れ</span><span begin="01:45.560" end="01:45.710">る</span><span begin="01:45.710" end="01:45.920">な</span><span begin="01:45.920" end="01:46.510">ら</span> <span begin="01:46.920" end="01:47.120">捨</span><span begin="01:47.300" end="01:47.750">て</span><span begin="01:47.750" end="01:47.900">さ</span><span begin="01:47.990" end="01:48.410">せ</span><span begin="01:48.540" end="01:48.770">て</span><span begin="01:48.770" end="01:49.390">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果真的能够舍弃 那就让我舍弃吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果真的能夠捨棄 那就讓我捨棄吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I can throw it away then let me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">버릴 수 있다면 제발 버리게 해 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si je peux m’en débarrasser alors laisse-moi le faire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si puedo tirarlo entonces déjame hacerlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich es fortwerfen kann dann lass mich doch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se posso jogá-la fora então deixe que eu jogue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если его можно выбросить то позвольте мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se posso gettarlo via allora lasciatemelo fare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Suterareru nara sutesasete yo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:49.910" end="01:54.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:49.910" end="01:50.150">死</span><span begin="01:50.150" end="01:50.660">ぬ</span><span begin="01:50.660" end="01:50.890">の</span><span begin="01:50.890" end="01:51.320">は</span><span begin="01:51.400" end="01:51.510">ま</span><span begin="01:51.590" end="01:52.120">だ</span><span begin="01:52.120" end="01:52.660">怖</span><span begin="01:52.660" end="01:52.830">い</span><span begin="01:52.830" end="01:53.000">か</span><span begin="01:53.080" end="01:54.790">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我现在 还害怕死亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我現在 還害怕死亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I'm still afraid to die</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">죽는 건 아직 무서우니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que mourir me fait encore peur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque todavía me da miedo morir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn vor dem Sterben habe ich noch immer Angst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque morrer ainda me dá medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь умереть мне всё ещё страшно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché morire mi fa ancora paura</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinu no wa mada kowai kara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:55.150" end="02:00.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:55.150" end="01:55.450">全</span><span begin="01:55.530" end="01:55.690">て</span><span begin="01:55.690" end="01:55.860">が</span><span begin="01:55.860" end="01:56.040">無</span><span begin="01:56.040" end="01:56.230">意</span><span begin="01:56.230" end="01:56.400">味</span><span begin="01:56.400" end="01:56.590">で</span><span begin="01:56.590" end="01:56.740">無</span><span begin="01:56.740" end="01:56.920">価</span><span begin="01:56.920" end="01:57.090">値</span><span begin="01:57.090" end="01:57.260">で</span><span begin="01:57.260" end="01:57.640">消</span><span begin="01:57.640" end="01:57.870">え</span><span begin="01:57.990" end="01:58.320">て</span><span begin="01:58.320" end="01:58.550">し</span><span begin="01:58.690" end="01:59.070">ま</span><span begin="01:59.070" end="01:59.410">い</span><span begin="01:59.410" end="01:59.720">た</span><span begin="01:59.800" end="02:00.410">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都毫无意义 毫无价值 真想就这样消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一切都毫無意義 毫無價值 真想就這樣消失</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Everything feels meaningless and worthless and I want to disappear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 게 무의미하고 무가치해서 사라져 버리고 싶어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout est absurde sans valeur et je voudrais disparaître</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo carece de sentido y de valor y quiero desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles ist bedeutungslos und wertlos und ich möchte einfach verschwinden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo parece sem sentido sem valor e eu quero desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё бессмысленно всё ничего не стоит и я хочу исчезнуть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto è privo di senso e di valore e vorrei soltanto scomparire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete ga muimi de mukachi de kiete shimaitai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.860" end="02:06.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:00.860" end="02:01.040">な</span><span begin="02:01.040" end="02:01.200">の</span><span begin="02:01.200" end="02:01.370">に</span><span begin="02:01.370" end="02:01.800">想</span><span begin="02:01.800" end="02:01.910">っ</span><span begin="02:01.910" end="02:02.080">て</span><span begin="02:02.080" end="02:02.530">縋</span><span begin="02:02.530" end="02:02.630">っ</span><span begin="02:02.630" end="02:02.820">て</span><span begin="02:02.820" end="02:02.960">無</span><span begin="02:02.960" end="02:03.690">様</span><span begin="02:03.690" end="02:03.990">に</span><span begin="02:04.080" end="02:04.680">願</span><span begin="02:04.680" end="02:04.780">っ</span><span begin="02:04.780" end="02:05.100">て</span><span begin="02:05.100" end="02:05.390">し</span><span begin="02:05.480" end="02:05.840">ま</span><span begin="02:05.840" end="02:06.110">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我偏偏还会思念 还会紧紧抓住 还会狼狈地祈求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可我偏偏還會思念 還會緊緊抓住 還會狼狽地祈求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And yet I still care still cling on still make these pathetic wishes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런데도 그리워하고 매달리고 꼴사납게 바라 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant j’aime encore je m’accroche encore et je finis par supplier pitoyablement</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así sigo sintiendo me aferro y termino suplicando miserablemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und trotzdem denke ich an etwas klammere mich daran und wünsche erbärmlich weiter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo assim continuo sentindo me agarrando e desejando de forma tão patética</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И всё же я думаю цепляюсь и жалко продолжаю молить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure continuo a pensare ad aggrapparmi e a desiderare senza alcuna dignità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Na no ni omotte sugatte buzama ni negatte shimau</span></p>
      <p begin="02:06.590" end="02:11.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:06.590" end="02:06.930">暈</span><span begin="02:06.930" end="02:07.030">け</span><span begin="02:07.110" end="02:07.250">た</span><span begin="02:07.250" end="02:07.450">視</span><span begin="02:07.450" end="02:07.810">界</span><span begin="02:07.810" end="02:08.000">か</span><span begin="02:08.000" end="02:08.200">ら</span><span begin="02:08.200" end="02:08.350">逃</span><span begin="02:08.350" end="02:08.530">げ</span><span begin="02:08.530" end="02:08.720">た</span><span begin="02:08.720" end="02:09.800">私</span><span begin="02:09.800" end="02:10.140">の</span><span begin="02:10.140" end="02:10.520">カ</span><span begin="02:10.520" end="02:10.860">ケ</span><span begin="02:10.860" end="02:11.250">ラ</span><span begin="02:11.250" end="02:11.830">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从模糊的视野中逃走的那一片属于我的碎屑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從模糊的視野中逃走的那一片屬於我的碎屑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">May the fragment of me that escaped my blurred vision</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">흐려진 시야에서 달아난 나의 조각이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce fragment de moi qui s’est échappé de ma vision brouillée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El fragmento de mí que escapó de mi visión borrosa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Stück von mir das aus meinem verschwommenen Blickfeld entflohen ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que o fragmento de mim que fugiu para além da minha visão turva</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть осколок меня сбежавший из затуманенного мира</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quel frammento di me fuggito oltre la mia vista annebbiata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Boyaketa shikai kara nigeta watashi no kakera ga</span></p>
      <p begin="02:12.290" end="02:16.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:12.290" end="02:12.640">どう</span><span begin="02:12.640" end="02:12.830">か</span><span begin="02:12.830" end="02:13.220">遠</span><span begin="02:13.220" end="02:13.560">い</span><span begin="02:13.560" end="02:13.700">場</span><span begin="02:13.700" end="02:13.930">所</span><span begin="02:13.930" end="02:14.260">で</span><span begin="02:14.260" end="02:14.670">笑</span><span begin="02:14.670" end="02:14.950">え</span><span begin="02:14.950" end="02:15.100">ま</span><span begin="02:15.200" end="02:15.700">す</span><span begin="02:15.700" end="02:15.980">よう</span><span begin="02:15.980" end="02:16.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但愿能在遥远的某处 好好地笑着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但願能在遙遠的某處 好好地笑著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Somehow be smiling somewhere far away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부디 먼 곳에서는 웃을 수 있기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisse-t-il sourire quelque part au loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ojalá pueda sonreír en algún lugar lejano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich hoffe nur dass es irgendwo weit fort lächeln kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Consiga sorrir em algum lugar distante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сможет улыбаться где-нибудь далеко</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Spero possa sorridere in qualche luogo lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Douka tooi basho de waraemasu you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="02:17.080" end="02:22.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:17.080" end="02:18.030">私</span><span begin="02:18.030" end="02:18.460">じゃ</span><span begin="02:18.540" end="02:18.810">な</span><span begin="02:18.810" end="02:19.420">い</span> <span begin="02:19.950" end="02:20.840">私</span><span begin="02:20.920" end="02:21.400">な</span><span begin="02:21.400" end="02:21.660">の</span><span begin="02:21.660" end="02:22.280">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明是我 却又不是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">明明是我 卻又不是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's not me Even though it is me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 아니야 분명 나인데도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’est pas moi pourtant c’est moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No soy yo aunque sea yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das bin nicht ich obwohl ich es doch bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sou eu embora seja eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это не я хотя это я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sono io eppure sono io</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ja nai watashi na no ni</span></p>
      <p begin="02:22.810" end="02:30.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:22.810" end="02:23.670">私</span><span begin="02:23.750" end="02:24.180">じゃ</span><span begin="02:24.270" end="02:24.470">な</span><span begin="02:24.570" end="02:25.140">い</span> <span begin="02:25.660" end="02:26.590">私</span><span begin="02:26.590" end="02:27.010">だ</span><span begin="02:27.090" end="02:27.370">か</span><span begin="02:27.370" end="02:30.150">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是我 正因为那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不是我 正因為那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's not me Because it is me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 아니야 바로 나이기 때문에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’est pas moi parce que c’est moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No soy yo porque soy yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das bin nicht ich gerade weil ich es bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sou eu justamente porque sou eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это не я потому что это я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sono io proprio perché sono io</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ja nai watashi dakara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:34.220" end="02:40.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:34.220" end="02:35.090">心</span><span begin="02:35.190" end="02:35.570">に</span><span begin="02:35.670" end="02:36.080">爪</span><span begin="02:36.080" end="02:36.520">を</span><span begin="02:37.080" end="02:37.190">立</span><span begin="02:37.270" end="02:37.710">て</span><span begin="02:37.790" end="02:37.970">て</span><span begin="02:37.970" end="02:38.680">箱</span><span begin="02:38.770" end="02:39.660">に</span><span begin="02:39.760" end="02:40.160">仕</span><span begin="02:40.160" end="02:40.760">舞</span><span begin="02:40.760" end="02:40.820">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用指甲狠狠掐住这颗心 再将它锁进箱中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">用指甲狠狠掐住這顆心 再將它鎖進箱中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I dig my nails into my heart and shut it away in a box</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음에 손톱을 세우고 상자 안에 넣어 둬</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’enfonce mes ongles dans mon cœur et je l’enferme dans une boîte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Clavo las uñas en mi corazón y lo guardo en una caja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich schlage die Nägel ins Herz und schließe es in eine Kiste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cravo as unhas no coração e o guardo dentro de uma caixa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вонзаю ногти в сердце и прячу его в коробку</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Affondo le unghie nel cuore e lo chiudo in una scatola</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kokoro ni tsume o tatete hako ni shimau</span></p>
      <p begin="02:41.240" end="02:46.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:41.240" end="02:41.960">悩</span><span begin="02:41.960" end="02:42.230">み</span><span begin="02:42.310" end="02:42.680">は</span><span begin="02:42.680" end="02:42.910">吐</span><span begin="02:43.010" end="02:43.350">き</span><span begin="02:43.350" end="02:43.590">出</span><span begin="02:43.690" end="02:44.000">せ</span><span begin="02:44.080" end="02:44.380">な</span><span begin="02:44.380" end="02:44.810">い</span><span begin="02:44.810" end="02:45.150">よ</span><span begin="02:45.150" end="02:45.510">う</span><span begin="02:45.510" end="02:45.850">に</span><span begin="02:45.850" end="02:46.400">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为了让那些烦恼再也无法倾吐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只為了讓那些煩惱再也無法傾吐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So none of my troubles can ever spill out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고민을 토해 낼 수 없도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour que mes tourments ne puissent jamais en sortir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para no poder sacar de allí mis angustias</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit kein einziger Kummer mehr nach draußen dringen kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para que minhas angústias jamais consigam escapar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы тревоги не смогли вырваться наружу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così che le mie angosce non possano più venire fuori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nayami wa hakidasenai you ni to</span></p>
      <p begin="02:47.080" end="02:52.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:47.080" end="02:47.810">時</span><span begin="02:47.810" end="02:48.010">が</span><span begin="02:48.010" end="02:48.470">経</span><span begin="02:48.560" end="02:48.670">て</span><span begin="02:48.750" end="02:49.350">ば</span><span begin="02:49.940" end="02:50.500">腐</span><span begin="02:50.500" end="02:50.660">っ</span><span begin="02:50.660" end="02:50.780">て</span><span begin="02:50.870" end="02:51.270">朽</span><span begin="02:51.360" end="02:51.490">ち</span><span begin="02:51.620" end="02:52.370">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听说只要任岁月流逝 它终会腐烂朽坏</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">聽說只要任歲月流逝 它終會腐爛朽壞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">They say with time they'll rot and decay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간이 흐르면 썩고 문드러져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On dit qu’avec le temps ils pourriront et tomberont en poussière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dicen que con el tiempo se pudren y se deshacen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit der Zeit soll alles verfaulen und zerfallen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dizem que com o passar do tempo tudo apodrece e se desfaz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Говорят со временем всё сгниёт и истлеет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dicono che con il tempo marciranno e si sgretoleranno</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Toki ga tateba kusatte kuchite</span></p>
      <p begin="02:52.800" end="02:57.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:52.800" end="02:52.900">無</span><span begin="02:53.000" end="02:53.410">か</span><span begin="02:53.410" end="02:53.520">っ</span><span begin="02:53.520" end="02:53.650">た</span><span begin="02:53.750" end="02:54.400">事</span><span begin="02:54.490" end="02:54.990">に</span><span begin="02:54.990" end="02:55.200">な</span><span begin="02:55.200" end="02:55.570">る</span><span begin="02:55.570" end="02:55.720">っ</span><span begin="02:55.720" end="02:55.840">て</span><span begin="02:55.930" end="02:57.320">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终就能当作从未发生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">最終就能當作從未發生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Until it's as though they were never there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">애초에 없었던 일이 된다면서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jusqu’à faire comme s’ils n’avaient jamais existé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hasta quedar como si nunca hubieran existido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bis es so ist als wäre es nie geschehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até parecer que nunca aconteceu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И станет будто этого никогда не было</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fino a diventare come se non fossero mai esistite</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nakatta koto ni naru tte sa</span></p>
      <p begin="02:57.670" end="03:02.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:57.670" end="02:58.010">な</span><span begin="02:58.010" end="02:58.390">の</span><span begin="02:58.390" end="02:58.610">に</span><span begin="02:58.700" end="02:58.930">ず</span><span begin="02:58.930" end="02:59.100">っ</span><span begin="02:59.100" end="02:59.470">と</span><span begin="02:59.940" end="03:00.140">消</span><span begin="03:00.140" end="03:00.290">え</span><span begin="03:00.290" end="03:00.490">ず</span><span begin="03:00.490" end="03:00.900">に</span><span begin="03:01.400" end="03:01.800">残</span><span begin="03:01.800" end="03:01.940">っ</span><span begin="03:01.940" end="03:02.160">て</span><span begin="03:02.160" end="03:02.500">い</span><span begin="03:02.500" end="03:02.670">る</span><span begin="03:02.670" end="03:02.990">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可它偏偏一直没有消失 仍残留至今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可它偏偏一直沒有消失 仍殘留至今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And yet they linger on without ever fading</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그런데도 줄곧 사라지지 않은 채 남아 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant ils restent là sans jamais disparaître</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así siguen ahí sin desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und trotzdem bleibt es für immer hier und verschwindet nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E mesmo assim continua aqui sem jamais desaparecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но оно всё не исчезает и остаётся</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E invece continuano a restare senza mai scomparire</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Na no ni zutto kiezu ni nokotte iru no</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.520" end="03:08.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:03.520" end="03:03.620">意</span><span begin="03:03.700" end="03:04.060">地</span><span begin="03:04.060" end="03:04.840">汚</span><span begin="03:04.840" end="03:05.230">く</span> <span begin="03:05.660" end="03:06.170">愛</span><span begin="03:06.170" end="03:06.570">し</span><span begin="03:06.570" end="03:06.920">い</span><span begin="03:06.920" end="03:07.300">ほ</span><span begin="03:07.300" end="03:07.570">ど</span><span begin="03:07.570" end="03:08.860">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那般不肯消散 甚至令人心生眷恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那般不肯消散 甚至令人心生眷戀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So stubbornly that they've almost become dear to me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지독하게도 애틋할 만큼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec une obstination sordide presque attendrissante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con una obstinación casi entrañable</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So erbärmlich hartnäckig und doch so liebenswert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agarrando-se sem pudor a ponto de se tornar querido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Бесстыдно цепляясь за жизнь и до боли родное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tenaci e sfrontate fino a diventarmi care</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ijigitanaku itoshii hodo ni</span></p>
      <p begin="03:09.240" end="03:14.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:09.240" end="03:09.420">名</span><span begin="03:09.420" end="03:09.800">前</span><span begin="03:09.800" end="03:10.120">を</span><span begin="03:10.120" end="03:10.320">つ</span><span begin="03:10.320" end="03:10.420">け</span><span begin="03:10.520" end="03:10.890">て</span><span begin="03:11.370" end="03:11.710">優</span><span begin="03:11.710" end="03:11.850">し</span><span begin="03:11.930" end="03:12.300">く</span><span begin="03:12.810" end="03:12.910">抱</span><span begin="03:12.990" end="03:13.330">き</span><span begin="03:13.330" end="03:13.710">し</span><span begin="03:13.710" end="03:13.900">め</span><span begin="03:13.900" end="03:14.100">た</span><span begin="03:14.100" end="03:14.440">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为它取一个名字 再温柔地拥入怀中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若是為它取一個名字 再溫柔地擁入懷中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What if I gave them a name and held them gently</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이름을 붙여 주고 다정히 끌어안는다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si je leur donnais un nom puis les serrais doucement dans mes bras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si les pusiera un nombre y las abrazara con ternura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich ihm einen Namen gäbe und es sanft in die Arme nähme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E se eu lhe desse um nome e o abraçasse com carinho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А что если дать ему имя и нежно обнять</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se potessi dare loro un nome e stringerle dolcemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namae o tsukete yasashiku dakishimetara</span></p>
      <p begin="03:14.830" end="03:21.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:14.830" end="03:15.140">な</span><span begin="03:15.140" end="03:15.330">ん</span><span begin="03:15.330" end="03:15.470">て</span><span begin="03:15.550" end="03:16.270">さ</span> <span begin="03:16.940" end="03:17.530">思</span><span begin="03:17.530" end="03:17.680">っ</span><span begin="03:17.680" end="03:18.000">て</span><span begin="03:18.000" end="03:18.260">し</span><span begin="03:18.260" end="03:18.500">ま</span><span begin="03:18.500" end="03:21.550">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种事啊 我竟还是忍不住想过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這種事啊 我竟還是忍不住想過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I catch myself thinking things like that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그럴 수 있다면 좋겠다고 생각해 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà le genre de chose que je finis par imaginer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Eso es lo que termino pensando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So etwas denke ich dann doch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Às vezes acabo pensando nisso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот о чём я невольно думаю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ecco finisco perfino per pensarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nante sa omotte shimau</span></p>
      <p begin="03:38.730" end="03:43.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:38.730" end="03:38.910">ど</span><span begin="03:38.910" end="03:39.050">れ</span><span begin="03:39.050" end="03:39.430">程</span><span begin="03:39.430" end="03:39.760">大</span><span begin="03:39.760" end="03:40.100">切</span><span begin="03:40.180" end="03:40.490">に</span><span begin="03:40.490" end="03:40.720">し</span><span begin="03:40.870" end="03:41.280">て</span><span begin="03:41.280" end="03:41.430">い</span><span begin="03:41.570" end="03:41.880">た</span><span begin="03:41.980" end="03:42.170">も</span><span begin="03:42.320" end="03:42.610">の</span><span begin="03:42.720" end="03:43.630">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论曾经多么珍而重之的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論曾經多麼珍而重之的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Everything I once treasured so dearly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그토록 소중히 간직했던 것들도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même tout ce qui m’était si précieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo aquello que tanto atesoré</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">All die Dinge die mir einst so unendlich viel bedeuteten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo aquilo que um dia guardei com tanto carinho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё что когда-то было мне так дорого</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto ciò che un tempo custodivo con tanto amore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dore hodo taisetsu ni shite ita mono mo</span></p>
      <p begin="03:44.460" end="03:49.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:44.460" end="03:44.620">あ</span><span begin="03:44.620" end="03:44.770">ん</span><span begin="03:44.770" end="03:44.950">な</span><span begin="03:44.950" end="03:45.140">に</span><span begin="03:45.140" end="03:45.470">大</span><span begin="03:45.470" end="03:45.600">好</span><span begin="03:45.680" end="03:45.870">き</span><span begin="03:45.870" end="03:46.060">だ</span><span begin="03:46.060" end="03:46.240">っ</span><span begin="03:46.240" end="03:46.600">た</span><span begin="03:46.600" end="03:46.950">あ</span><span begin="03:46.950" end="03:47.320">の</span><span begin="03:47.320" end="03:48.040">温</span><span begin="03:48.040" end="03:48.370">も</span><span begin="03:48.370" end="03:48.610">り</span><span begin="03:48.720" end="03:49.320">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论那曾让我如此眷恋的温度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論那曾讓我如此眷戀的溫度</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even that warmth I loved so much</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇게나 사랑했던 그 온기도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même cette chaleur que j’aimais tant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Incluso aquel calor que tanto llegué a amar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch jene Wärme die ich so sehr geliebt habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Até aquele calor que eu amava tanto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И то тепло которое я так сильно любила</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perfino quel calore che amavo così tanto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anna ni daisuki datta ano nukumori mo</span></p>
      <p begin="03:50.110" end="03:55.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:50.110" end="03:50.460">必</span><span begin="03:50.460" end="03:50.790">要</span><span begin="03:50.890" end="03:51.040">な</span><span begin="03:51.040" end="03:51.240">い</span><span begin="03:51.240" end="03:51.390">な</span><span begin="03:51.390" end="03:51.530">ら</span><span begin="03:51.610" end="03:51.940">い</span><span begin="03:51.940" end="03:52.260">っ</span><span begin="03:52.260" end="03:52.660">そ</span><span begin="03:52.660" end="03:53.360">今</span><span begin="03:53.360" end="03:53.580">此</span><span begin="03:53.700" end="03:54.100">処</span><span begin="03:54.100" end="03:55.060">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若这一切都已经不再需要 那就干脆在此刻此地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若這一切都已經不再需要 那就乾脆在此刻此地</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I don't need any of it then right here right now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">필요 없는 거라면 차라리 지금 여기서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si rien de tout cela n’est nécessaire alors ici et maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si ya no hace falta entonces aquí y ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn ich sie nicht brauche dann bitte gleich hier und jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se nada disso é necessário então de uma vez aqui e agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если всё это больше не нужно тогда прямо здесь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se non serve più allora proprio qui e ora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hitsuyou nai nara isso ima koko de</span></p>
      <p begin="03:55.820" end="04:00.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:55.820" end="03:56.210">感</span><span begin="03:56.210" end="03:56.590">情</span><span begin="03:56.590" end="03:56.950">全</span><span begin="03:56.950" end="03:57.080">部</span><span begin="03:57.080" end="03:57.510">殺</span><span begin="03:57.640" end="03:57.830">し</span><span begin="03:58.000" end="03:58.390">て</span><span begin="03:58.390" end="04:00.880">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我所有的感情统统杀死吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將我所有的感情統統殺死吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Kill every feeling inside me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 감정을 전부 죽여 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tue tous mes sentiments</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mata todas mis emociones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Töte all meine Gefühle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mate todos os meus sentimentos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Убей все мои чувства</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uccidi tutte le mie emozioni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanjou zenbu koroshite yo</span></p>
      <p begin="04:01.560" end="04:06.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="04:01.560" end="04:01.840">感</span><span begin="04:01.940" end="04:02.290">情</span><span begin="04:02.290" end="04:02.660">全</span><span begin="04:02.660" end="04:02.830">部</span><span begin="04:02.830" end="04:03.270">殺</span><span begin="04:03.350" end="04:03.620">し</span><span begin="04:03.720" end="04:04.090">て</span><span begin="04:04.090" end="04:06.490">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我所有的感情统统杀死吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將我所有的感情統統殺死吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Kill every feeling inside me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 감정을 전부 죽여 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tue tous mes sentiments</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mata todas mis emociones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Töte all meine Gefühle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mate todos os meus sentimentos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Убей все мои чувства</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uccidi tutte le mie emozioni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanjou zenbu koroshite yo</span></p>
      <p begin="04:07.260" end="04:12.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="04:07.260" end="04:07.470">区</span><span begin="04:07.470" end="04:07.830">別</span><span begin="04:07.830" end="04:08.000">も</span><span begin="04:08.000" end="04:08.260">な</span><span begin="04:08.260" end="04:08.350">い</span><span begin="04:08.350" end="04:08.550">よ</span><span begin="04:08.550" end="04:08.710">う</span><span begin="04:08.710" end="04:08.960">に</span><span begin="04:09.040" end="04:09.300">し</span><span begin="04:09.420" end="04:09.810">て</span><span begin="04:09.810" end="04:12.210">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让它们再也没有任何区别吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓它們再也沒有任何區別吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Erase every difference between them</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아무런 구별조차 남지 않게 해 줘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fais en sorte qu’il n’y ait plus aucune différence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Haz que ya no exista ninguna diferencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mach sie alle ununterscheidbar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Faça com que já não haja diferença entre eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сделай так чтобы между нами не осталось различий</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa' che non rimanga più alcuna distinzione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kubetsu mo nai you ni shite yo</span></p>
      <p begin="04:12.970" end="04:17.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="04:12.970" end="04:13.330">平</span><span begin="04:13.330" end="04:13.720">等</span><span begin="04:13.720" end="04:14.020">に</span><span begin="04:14.020" end="04:14.670">幸</span><span begin="04:14.750" end="04:15.040">せ</span><span begin="04:15.150" end="04:15.390">に</span><span begin="04:15.520" end="04:15.770">な</span><span begin="04:15.860" end="04:16.220">れ</span><span begin="04:16.220" end="04:16.590">る</span><span begin="04:16.590" end="04:17.110">の</span><span begin="04:17.110" end="04:17.310">な</span><span begin="04:17.390" end="04:17.890">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果这样一来 所有人都能平等地得到幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如果這樣一來 所有人都能平等地得到幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If that would let everyone be equally happy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그렇게 해서 모두가 똑같이 행복해질 수 있다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si c’est ainsi que tout le monde peut être heureux de la même manière</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si así todos podemos ser felices por igual</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn wir dadurch alle gleichermaßen glücklich werden können</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se assim todos puderem ser igualmente felizes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если тогда все смогут быть одинаково счастливы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se così tutti potranno essere felici allo stesso modo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Byoudou ni shiawase ni nareru no nara</span></p>
      <p begin="04:18.410" end="04:21.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="04:18.410" end="04:18.680">ほ</span><span begin="04:18.680" end="04:19.070">ら</span><span begin="04:19.070" end="04:19.100">、</span><span begin="04:21.220" end="04:21.920">今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么 来吧 就现在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那麼 來吧 就現在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Come on now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자 지금</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors vas-y maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Vamos ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dann komm jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ну же сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Avanti fallo adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hora, ima</span></p>
      <p begin="04:23.680" end="04:28.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="04:23.680" end="04:23.920">も</span><span begin="04:23.920" end="04:24.180">う</span><span begin="04:24.410" end="04:24.760">苦</span><span begin="04:24.760" end="04:25.000">し</span><span begin="04:25.000" end="04:25.150">ん</span><span begin="04:25.150" end="04:25.500">で</span><span begin="04:25.500" end="04:25.840">悲</span><span begin="04:25.840" end="04:26.070">し</span><span begin="04:26.070" end="04:26.250">ん</span><span begin="04:26.250" end="04:26.570">で</span><span begin="04:26.570" end="04:26.970">笑</span><span begin="04:26.970" end="04:27.140">う</span><span begin="04:27.140" end="04:27.300">こ</span><span begin="04:27.300" end="04:27.560">と</span><span begin="04:27.650" end="04:28.010">も</span><span begin="04:28.010" end="04:28.320">な</span><span begin="04:28.400" end="04:28.960">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从此再也不会痛苦 不会悲伤 也不会欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從此再也不會痛苦 不會悲傷 也不會歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Then I'll never suffer grieve or smile again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 괴로워하고 슬퍼하고 웃을 일도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne souffrirai plus je ne serai plus triste et je ne rirai plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no sufriré ni me entristeceré ni volveré a reír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dann werde ich nie wieder leiden trauern oder lachen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais vou sofrer me entristecer nem sorrir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я больше не буду страдать печалиться и смеяться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così non dovrò più soffrire essere triste né sorridere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou kurushinde kanashinde warau koto mo nai</span></p>
      <p begin="04:29.430" end="04:34.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="04:29.430" end="04:29.660">も</span><span begin="04:29.660" end="04:29.890">う</span><span begin="04:30.170" end="04:30.740">喜</span><span begin="04:30.740" end="04:30.870">ん</span><span begin="04:30.870" end="04:31.210">で</span><span begin="04:31.210" end="04:31.560">時</span><span begin="04:31.560" end="04:31.770">め</span><span begin="04:31.770" end="04:31.860">い</span><span begin="04:31.940" end="04:32.190">て</span><span begin="04:32.280" end="04:32.690">歌</span><span begin="04:32.690" end="04:32.840">う</span><span begin="04:32.840" end="04:33.020">こ</span><span begin="04:33.020" end="04:33.360">と</span><span begin="04:33.360" end="04:33.610">も</span><span begin="04:33.710" end="04:34.230">な</span><span begin="04:34.230" end="04:34.480">い</span><span begin="04:34.480" end="04:34.780">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从此再也不会欣喜 不会心动 也不会歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從此再也不會欣喜 不會心動 也不會歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Never rejoice feel my heart race or sing again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제 기뻐하고 설레고 노래할 일도 없는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne me réjouirai plus mon cœur ne frémira plus et je ne chanterai plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no sentiré alegría ni emoción ni volveré a cantar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nie wieder Freude fühlen Herzklopfen spüren oder singen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais vou me alegrar sentir o coração palpitar nem cantar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я больше не буду радоваться трепетать и петь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non dovrò più gioire emozionarmi né cantare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mou yorokonde tokimeite utau koto mo nai no</span></p>
      <p begin="04:35.140" end="04:40.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="04:35.140" end="04:35.370">た</span><span begin="04:35.370" end="04:35.600">だ</span><span begin="04:35.880" end="04:36.040">剥</span><span begin="04:36.040" end="04:36.160">が</span><span begin="04:36.160" end="04:36.380">さ</span><span begin="04:36.380" end="04:36.470">れ</span><span begin="04:36.590" end="04:36.950">て</span><span begin="04:36.950" end="04:37.100">落</span><span begin="04:37.100" end="04:37.190">ち</span><span begin="04:37.290" end="04:37.500">て</span><span begin="04:37.500" end="04:37.650">い</span><span begin="04:37.650" end="04:37.990">く</span><span begin="04:37.990" end="04:38.370">古</span><span begin="04:38.370" end="04:38.540">び</span><span begin="04:38.540" end="04:38.700">た</span><span begin="04:38.700" end="04:39.010">カ</span><span begin="04:39.090" end="04:39.460">ケ</span><span begin="04:39.460" end="04:39.840">ラ</span><span begin="04:39.840" end="04:40.420">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩那些被一点点剥落 坠下的陈旧碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只剩那些被一點點剝落 墜下的陳舊碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">May those worn-out fragments peeling away and falling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그저 벗겨져 떨어져 가는 낡은 조각들을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces vieux fragments qui se détachent simplement et tombent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los viejos fragmentos que se desprenden y caen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mögen die alten Stücke die sich einfach ablösen und herabfallen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que estes velhos fragmentos arrancados de mim e caindo pelo caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть лишь старые осколки что отслаиваются и падают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quei vecchi frammenti che si staccano e cadono uno dopo l'altro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada hagasarete ochite iku furubita kakera wa</span></p>
      <p begin="04:40.890" end="04:45.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="04:40.890" end="04:41.600">風</span><span begin="04:41.600" end="04:42.090">が</span><span begin="04:42.090" end="04:42.630">運</span><span begin="04:42.630" end="04:42.830">ん</span><span begin="04:42.830" end="04:43.010">で</span><span begin="04:43.010" end="04:43.560">く</span><span begin="04:43.560" end="04:43.660">れ</span><span begin="04:43.750" end="04:44.130">ま</span><span begin="04:44.130" end="04:44.250">す</span><span begin="04:44.250" end="04:44.530">よう</span><span begin="04:44.530" end="04:45.310">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但愿能由风替我带走</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">但願能由風替我帶走</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Be carried away by the wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부디 바람이 데려가 주기를</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisse le vent les emporter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ojalá el viento se los lleve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vom Wind fortgetragen werden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sejam levados pelo vento</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Унесёт с собой ветер</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Spero che il vento li porti via</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kaze ga hakonde kuremasu you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="04:45.660" end="04:50.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="04:45.660" end="04:46.520">私</span><span begin="04:46.600" end="04:47.090">じゃ</span><span begin="04:47.090" end="04:47.390">な</span><span begin="04:47.390" end="04:47.990">い</span> <span begin="04:48.530" end="04:49.480">私</span><span begin="04:49.480" end="04:49.970">だ</span><span begin="04:49.970" end="04:50.250">か</span><span begin="04:50.250" end="04:50.870">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是我 正因为那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不是我 正因為那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's not me Because it is me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 아니야 바로 나이기 때문에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’est pas moi parce que c’est moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No soy yo porque soy yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das bin nicht ich gerade weil ich es bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sou eu justamente porque sou eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это не я потому что это я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sono io proprio perché sono io</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ja nai watashi dakara</span></p>
      <p begin="04:51.400" end="04:58.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="04:51.400" end="04:52.350">私</span><span begin="04:52.350" end="04:52.840">じゃ</span><span begin="04:52.840" end="04:53.080">な</span><span begin="04:53.180" end="04:53.710">い</span> <span begin="04:54.220" end="04:55.170">私</span><span begin="04:55.170" end="04:55.660">だ</span><span begin="04:55.660" end="04:55.880">か</span><span begin="04:56.000" end="04:58.910">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不是我 正因为那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不是我 正因為那就是我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It's not me Because it is me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 아니야 바로 나이기 때문에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ce n’est pas moi parce que c’est moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No soy yo porque soy yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das bin nicht ich gerade weil ich es bin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sou eu justamente porque sou eu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это не я потому что это я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sono io proprio perché sono io</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Watashi ja nai watashi dakara</span></p>
      <p begin="04:59.770" end="05:03.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="04:59.770" end="05:00.060">窓</span><span begin="05:00.060" end="05:00.140">に</span><span begin="05:00.140" end="05:00.370">映</span><span begin="05:00.370" end="05:00.500">っ</span><span begin="05:00.500" end="05:00.610">た</span><span begin="05:00.610" end="05:00.790">自</span><span begin="05:00.790" end="05:01.010">分</span><span begin="05:01.010" end="05:01.160">の</span><span begin="05:01.160" end="05:01.440">顔</span><span begin="05:01.440" end="05:01.570">は</span><span begin="05:02.060" end="05:02.230">ちゃ</span><span begin="05:02.230" end="05:02.360">ん</span><span begin="05:02.360" end="05:02.480">と</span><span begin="05:02.480" end="05:02.700">笑</span><span begin="05:02.700" end="05:02.780">え</span><span begin="05:02.880" end="05:02.980">て</span><span begin="05:02.980" end="05:03.060">い</span><span begin="05:03.160" end="05:03.300">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">映在窗上的那张自己的脸 依旧好好地笑着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">映在窗上的那張自己的臉 依舊好好地笑著</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The face reflected in the window was smiling just the way it should</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">창문에 비친 내 얼굴은 제대로 웃고 있었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mon visage reflété dans la vitre souriait comme il faut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi rostro reflejado en la ventana había conseguido sonreír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Gesicht im Fenster konnte tatsächlich ganz normal lächeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O rosto refletido na janela estava sorrindo como deveria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Моё лицо в отражении окна улыбалось как надо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio volto riflesso nella finestra riusciva a sorridere come si deve</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mado ni utsutta jibun no kao wa chanto waraete ita</span></p>
      <p begin="05:04.090" end="05:06.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="05:04.090" end="05:04.120">「</span><span begin="05:04.120" end="05:04.260">そ</span><span begin="05:04.260" end="05:04.450">っ</span><span begin="05:04.450" end="05:04.640">か</span><span begin="05:04.640" end="05:04.670">、</span><span begin="05:05.190" end="05:05.310">そ</span><span begin="05:05.310" end="05:05.450">っ</span><span begin="05:05.450" end="05:05.620">ち</span><span begin="05:05.620" end="05:05.690">に</span><span begin="05:05.690" end="05:05.810">行</span><span begin="05:05.810" end="05:05.970">け</span><span begin="05:05.970" end="05:06.080">た</span><span begin="05:06.080" end="05:06.210">ん</span><span begin="05:06.210" end="05:06.370">だ</span><span begin="05:06.370" end="05:06.460">ね</span><span begin="05:06.460" end="05:06.490">」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">「这样啊 原来你已经去到那边了」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">「這樣啊 原來你已經去到那邊了」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">"Oh I see you made it over there"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">“그렇구나 그쪽으로 갈 수 있었구나”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">« Je vois alors tu as réussi à aller là-bas »</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">«Ya veo así que lograste llegar hasta allí»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">„Ach so du hast es also dorthin geschafft“</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">«Entendi então você conseguiu chegar aí»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">«Вот как значит ты всё-таки смогла туда добраться»</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">«Capisco ce l'hai fatta ad arrivare fin laggiù»</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">"Sokka, socchi ni iketanda ne"</span></p>
      <p begin="05:07.020" end="05:09.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="05:07.020" end="05:07.170">こ</span><span begin="05:07.170" end="05:07.260">の</span><span begin="05:07.260" end="05:07.570">物</span><span begin="05:07.570" end="05:07.960">語</span><span begin="05:07.960" end="05:08.060">は</span><span begin="05:08.490" end="05:08.620">こ</span><span begin="05:08.620" end="05:08.780">れ</span><span begin="05:08.780" end="05:08.880">で</span><span begin="05:08.880" end="05:08.980">お</span><span begin="05:09.060" end="05:09.340">終</span><span begin="05:09.340" end="05:09.420">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个故事 到这里便结束了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這個故事 到這裡便結束了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And this is where the story ends</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 이야기는 여기서 끝이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette histoire s’achève ici</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aquí termina esta historia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit ist diese Geschichte zu Ende</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E assim esta história chega ao fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">На этом эта история заканчивается</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questa storia finisce qui</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kono monogatari wa kore de oshimai</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
